<h2>Asobi Review 0.2 (build 394)</h2>
<p><b>Aspect ratio guides.</b></p>
<ul>
<li><b>Aspect Guides</b> (eye menu): framing standards drawn over the picture — 2.39:1 Scope, 2.00:1 Univisium, 1.85:1 Flat, 16:9, 4:3, and the social crops 9:16, 4:5, 1:1. Turn on several at once; each is labeled, follows the image through pan and zoom, and marks nothing — it's a viewing aid, on your screen only.</li>
</ul>
