<h2>Asobi Review 0.2 (build 389)</h2>
<p><b>Consistency pass: the app and the web page now behave — and read — the same.</b></p>
<ul>
<li>Fill toggle and fill-opacity slider now restyle the <i>selected</i> mark first, matching how color and width already worked.</li>
<li>Replies in the Comments window get the same tinted background and "Reply…" affordance as every other surface.</li>
<li>Cheat sheet fix: zoom presets are ⌘1–⌘4 (bare digits pick the compare set).</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
